Turning on mobile data will not affect or delete any of your photos or messages. It simply enables your phone to use the cellular network for internet access, which is necessary for sending MMS.

I will now proceed to turn on the mobile data for your phone number 555-123-2002.
{"recipient_name":"functions.toggle_data","parameters":{}}

Please run the command on your phone to set the network mode preference to "4g_5g_preferred." Once done, share the result with me so I can assist you further.
{
  "action": "set_network_mode_preference",
  "parameters": {
    "mode": "4g_5g_preferred"
  }
}
